        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Divide the problem into two parts: condition and cost.",
            "block_bbox": [
                80,
                175,
                580,
                199
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    80.0,
                    175.0
                ],
                [
                    580.0,
                    175.0
                ],
                [
                    580.0,
                    199.0
                ],
                [
                    80.0,
                    199.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5a. Is the condition the right kind for the problem?",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
                207,
                558,
                230
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    104.0,
                    207.0
                ],
                [
                    558.0,
                    207.0
                ],
                [
                    558.0,
                    230.0
                ],
                [
                    104.0,
                    230.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For a practical problem, the condition must be something that exacts a palpable cost.",
            "block_bbox": [
                146,
                245,
                770,
                295
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    146.0,
                    245.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    245.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    295.0
                ],
                [
                    146.0,
                    295.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For a conceptual problem, the condition must be something not known or understood. This should be stated not as a direct question, Why do people try to recycle things they can't?, but as a statement of what we do not know: But we do not know why education campaigns aimed at reducing aspirational recycling have generally proven ineffective.",
            "block_bbox": [
                146,
                303,
                772,
                433
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    146.0,
                    303.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    303.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    433.0
                ],
                [
                    146.0,
                    433.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5b. Does the cost appropriately answer So what?",
            "block_bbox": [
                103,
                445,
                536,
                468
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    103.0,
                    445.0
                ],
                [
                    536.0,
                    445.0
                ],
                [
                    536.0,
                    468.0
                ],
                [
                    103.0,
                    468.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For a practical problem, the answer to So what? must state some palpable consequence of the condition that causes unhappiness.",
            "block_bbox": [
                147,
                483,
                770,
                534
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    147.0,
                    483.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    483.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    534.0
                ],
                [
                    147.0,
                    534.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For a conceptual problem, the answer to So what? must state some more significant issue that is not known or understood.",
            "block_bbox": [
                146,
                541,
                771,
                591
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    146.0,
                    541.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    541.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    591.0
                ],
